event: final
data: {"type":"final","answer":"這篇論文在成本比較圖（Figure 2）中指出，該圖的結構「未能可靠重建」，因此在呈現 GraphRAG 與 LightRAG 在 Legal 資料集上的代幣與 API 呼叫成本時，圖表的細節無法完整重建，成為文件本身的限制之一[C4]。","citations":[{"id":"C4","source_id":"d7e5be2d87c44539a75250e220aabade:chunk-27","section":"4.5 MODEL COST AND ADAPTABILITY ANALYSIS (RQ4)","page_start":9,"page_end":9}],"unverified":[]}

